# base-account retains pam_nologin policy; base-session-noninteractive retains
# pam_env and pam_limits. Credential-only replacement must not remove these.
# openssh-server-pam supplies /usr/sbin/sshd.pam; default sshd lacks PAM.
# OpenRC selects sshd.pam for UsePAM yes. rc-service sshd reload is supported,
# but cannot migrate a running non-PAM executable to the PAM variant.
# Source build requires the project's pinned Zig plus musl-dev C headers;
# python3 runs the installer. linux-pam-dev is needed for the C PAM harness,
# not the production Zig module, which declares PAM ABI functions directly.
# Build and verification commands for an isolated Alpine x86_64 rootfs:
# zig build -Doptimize=ReleaseSafe
# zig build test
# python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -p test_profile_alpine.py
# These commands have NOT been run by this profile agent.

